{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14324","headline":"早秋江行 · 窦巩","name":"早秋江行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"回望湓城远，西风吹荻花。\n暮潮江势阔，秋雨鴈行斜。\n多醉浑无梦，频愁欲到家。\n渐惊云树转，数点是晨鵶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦巩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}